WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
How is it that some people always seem

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.160
to get what they want? They always have

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.360
these amazing opportunities, whether

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.960
it's their dream life, dream vacations,

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:13.520
style wardrobe, dream home, jet-set

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.800
lifestyle. This is a specific type of

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.960
mindset that can be achieved by anyone

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.680
who believes in it. In fact, the idea of

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.480
manifestation is actually very

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.560
scientific. Specifically, it is backed

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.880
by neuroscience. The self-fulfilling

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.840
prophecy was a term coined by Robert K.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:31.600
Merton in 1948 to describe predictions

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:33.480
coming true based on what people believe

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:36.200
about it. And eventually, there was also

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:38.960
a study done 20 years later in 1968 that

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:41.120
proves expectations can change outcomes

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.480
simply by exchanging our behavior and

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:45.680
our mindsets. It is all a form of

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.800
attention bias that favors

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:50.240
opportunities. The more we believe and

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.160
focus on something, anything, the more

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:54.280
likely we are to succeed at it. I

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:56.120
recently watched Eileen Gu's interviews

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:58.160
and shout-out to this baddie because she

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:00.880
is all about how neuroscience has helped

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.760
her win Olympic gold medals. It is all

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.960
in the mind, specifically the

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:07.600
subconscious mind, which takes up about

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.680
95% of our brain capacity and you are

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.520
not aware of anything that goes on

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.280
there. Everything that seems automatic

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:14.760
from you breathing in oxygen to

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.840
something that happened to you 10 years

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:19.640
ago that's still affects you today. This

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:21.520
all lives inside of your subconscious.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.360
But the good news is you can train your

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:25.040
subconscious mind to work for you. My

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:27.520
name is May. My channel is all about

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:29.280
transformation inside and out. I believe

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.800
we can find beauty and purpose and our

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:34.120
purpose in beauty. Think about it. If

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.920
you focus on is beauty, your life will

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:39.320
also be filled with beauty. It is

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:40.840
actually a very virtuously stoic concept

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:43.440
and that's why my community is called

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.200
Stoic Angels. And that is also why we're

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:47.200
going to Greece on my group trip this

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:49.080
July in the description if you want to

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.320
join. I have also made a free companion

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.040
guide to this video that you can

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.800
download in the description and as

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.720
always, I have chapters in my videos so

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.520
that you can skip around. But the point

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.000
is I get whatever I want because I

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.960
always want to put myself in the

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.760
position to win. There's no other

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:06.000
option. So there's no option that I can

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:08.960
lose so I never lose. My identity

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.560
rejects that idea altogether. The only

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:13.720
way that you can lose is if you let

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:15.640
yourself lose. I have to constantly

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.960
remind myself of what I've already done

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.560
and that I am so capable of doing even

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:22.480
better. The only thing I regret in my

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:24.360
life, honestly, if anything at all, is

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.360
that I didn't believe in myself enough

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:27.880
at some point. I didn't believe that I

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:30.480
could have gotten more or get what I

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:32.840
want in the past and that is a pity of

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:35.640
mine that I aim to overcome every time.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:38.160
The reticular activating system, RAS, in

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:41.200
our brain filters our subconscious mind

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:43.800
and decides what eventually gets into

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:45.520
our conscious state of awareness. We see

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.640
the world according to what we believe

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.960
in internally because of that reticular

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:52.600
activating system. So if you truly

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:54.640
believe that this will work out, your

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.320
brain literally shows you even more

00:02:54.640 --> 00:03:00.120
opportunities, patterns, and solutions.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:02.720
But if deep down you believe that this

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:04.760
probably won't work, your brain will not

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.360
show you opportunities and solutions and

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.600
it will show you more reasons why it

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:11.000
wouldn't work. That's why abundance

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:13.160
begets abundance and lack begets lack.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.800
It's how our brain works. So let's do

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:17.200
this. Take some time to write down all

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.200
of your achievements and be proud of

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.520
that. In fact, we can all take more

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.040
pride in ourselves because even I forget

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:26.760
sometimes and I would beat myself up a

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:28.880
bit. But then I realized that I'm doing

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.640
that and I stop immediately. Also being

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:32.200
negative all the time is not healthy. I

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:34.360
would never speak that way to someone I

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:36.040
believe in, you know what I mean? So we

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.280
can't allow that to happen. I talked

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.320
about this today actually with my

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:40.880
therapist that you have to be the one to

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:43.960
believe in yourself the most, more than

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:46.120
anyone else. So let's extend that grace

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:48.120
inwards. If you're still working on it,

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:50.440
just know that I believe in you. That's

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:53.160
why we're here. So let's do this

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:54.560
exercise together. For example, these

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:57.120
are some things that I'm really proud

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:59.000
of. Like I'm never someone who's lazy

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.440
and doesn't do anything. I don't look

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.280
for shortcuts all the time. I don't cut

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:05.520
corners. I absolutely walk the walk 24/7

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:07.640
and eventually built my dream life. The

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.080
results speak for themselves. I left my

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:12.360
home country and moved to New York City

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:14.640
on my own at the age of 17 and somehow I

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:16.359
made ends meet. I got multiple degrees

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:18.200
from my dream university that I got

00:04:16.359 --> 00:04:21.079
into. Before I became a YouTuber, I

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:23.080
worked my way up from making $3.50 an

00:04:21.079 --> 00:04:24.360
hour to becoming a music business

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.680
executive.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:28.960
I know I look young because my vibe is

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:32.320
youthful and my glow-up tips work,

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:34.600
period. And I lost almost 50 lb from my

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:37.520
highest weight. I had an insane,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:39.720
unrecognizable glow-up and I continue to

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:41.560
improve my life. I've already traveled

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:42.880
to third of the world, literally, and

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.320
I've been married to love of my life for

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:47.880
over 10 years. I've also never boasted

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.880
so much about myself until this moment.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.960
It's a little bit embarrassing, but

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:51.480
we're not going to be embarrassed about

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.840
our achievements. We should be proud of

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.480
it. Also, these are all things that I

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.600
had to fight for. But I'm no different

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:59.080
from anybody else. I didn't grow up to

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:01.320
be very privileged, which also led to a

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:03.920
battle with my mental health. My life is

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:06.800
a constant challenge with both good and

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:09.680
sometimes downright terrible situations

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:11.800
which I have to overcome. I have to go

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:13.680
through and end up better every time.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.040
There's no other option. I've even been

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:16.600
covering some of these stories on my

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.800
channel because there's always a lesson

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:20.480
to learn and I have been through some

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:22.720
very heavy things that nobody knows

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:25.160
about. Whatever it is though, like life

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:27.280
is all about overcoming and being better

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:29.560
than whatever tries to defeat you.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:32.200
Still, ultimately, despite everything, I

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:34.760
always eventually walk away with my best

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:36.560
possible outcome, not just for myself,

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:38.040
but for the greater good. Because the

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.520
other option would be to just give up,

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.720
which is not an option for me. And I

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.680
understand if sometimes we get

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:46.840
overwhelmed by things happening around

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:49.080
us, which is also a great opportunity to

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:51.320
develop more mental toughness for

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.480
ourselves and also make room for our

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:56.280
needs. The time will pass regardless and

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:58.280
this life is all we have. So let's focus

00:05:56.280 --> 00:06:00.520
on doing the best that we can, just for

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:02.960
us. If there's any kind of internal

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:05.120
blockages that you want to work through,

