betterhelp.com/mayalessozuki

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:34.640
and get 10% off your first month of

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:36.160
therapy. Any truth that you learn

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:37.520
outside of yourself, whether it's

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.200
something you read on the news, a

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:42.040
scientific study, or in a textbook, is

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.960
literally just what other people have

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:46.640
tried to prove or tried to convince you

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:49.360
is the truth and it only becomes your

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:50.600
truth too because you buy into it. You

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:52.080
believe it. I mentioned the

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:53.960
self-fulfilling prophecy earlier on

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:56.200
because your brain is a prediction

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:59.120
machine based on what you believe on the

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.920
inside. So objectively speaking, even

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:02.600
scientific studies can get things wrong

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:04.680
all the time or have biases because of

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:07.160
what the researchers believe in. There

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:09.520
is no real universal objective truth

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:11.880
except for what you agree to be the

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:13.280
truth. Meaning if an entire society

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:15.360
believes in the same thing, that thing

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:17.560
becomes the truth for that society. It

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:19.520
doesn't matter if somebody else doesn't

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:21.120
agree or if it's right or wrong. If two

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:23.400
people are arguing and they can't come

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.320
to an agreement, you best believe these

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:27.080
people will have two very different

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:29.360
ideas of what actually went down and

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:31.200
who's right and who's wrong. Again, we

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:32.480
don't actually know what the real right

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.720
or wrong looks like. Sometimes they're

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:35.240
both right, other times they're both

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.440
wrong. There's no way of knowing unless

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:39.600
you witness it and you come to your own

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:41.840
conclusions of your own truth. That's

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:43.720
why you're not responsible for what

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:47.360
other people think of you. That's their

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:49.440
perspective and not yours. I literally

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.680
do not care what anyone else thinks of

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:54.040
me when I proclaim that I am living my

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:55.920
dreams and you shouldn't care either, by

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.800
the way. If you think my life is easy

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:59.280
because I'm gorgeous, thank you so much.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:02.080
Like you're correct. I agree. I'm

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:04.800
actually gorgeneous, too, because I'm

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:07.000
also smart. I work hard for everything

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:08.960
so that it looks easy. But nobody handed

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.720
this to me. Everything that I achieve is

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:12.840
because of me. That's why I also do my

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.840
best to bless people around me. That's

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:16.480
my purpose and my truth, so nothing else

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:18.560
matters. If people are out there trying

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:20.840
to discredit anything of mine, I also

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.280
feel grateful about it because when

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:24.840
people think like that, they are

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:27.760
actually thinking this is too good to be

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:29.960
true for them, so it must be fake. If

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:32.960
whatever seems fake and out of reach to

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:34.520
them, that's my reality, that means that

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:36.919
I have reached my goals and in a way

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.240
they are affirming my truth as well. So

00:08:36.919 --> 00:08:40.360
that's the mindset that I'm very

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:43.320
grateful for. Obviously, if it's

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:44.680
egregious, like really mean attacks or

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.480
they're trying to insult you and bully

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:49.360
you, you should stand up for yourself.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:51.120
But regardless, you know your right and

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:52.520
your wrong. It's like they're pirates

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:54.200
and they try to steal your but you

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:56.680
are the captain of your ship. You're

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:58.000
still the one driving your narrative. So

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.680
people who don't want to be convinced

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.320
will never be convinced and there's no

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:03.720
way of controlling that. So the best you

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:06.160
can do is double down on your truth,

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:09.040
literally shoo them away, and continue

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:11.760
down the path of your truth regardless.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:13.560
Eventually, your world will look exactly

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:15.440
like how you imagine it to be and it

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:18.360
will bend to your beliefs. So don't let

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:20.240
other people's truths distort yours. On

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:22.480
the other hand, if you do bend to other

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:24.480
people's truths enough times, you will

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:26.200
end up with no truth of your own. And

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:28.480
you're in control of that experience.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:30.800
Now let's talk about repetition because

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:33.240
this is so important and so connected to

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.800
everything else. It takes time and

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:37.600
effort for your world to change, but

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:40.080
time isn't really a real concept. The

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.720
same thing goes for the objective truth.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:44.520
So once you believe in something hard

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:47.240
enough and often enough, it finds a home

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:49.520
in your subconscious mind. Repetition

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:52.320
and saturation will help you train that

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:54.960
subconscious. And sometimes change can

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:57.920
be really hard. Our brain hates the idea

00:09:54.960 --> 00:10:01.280
of uncertainty and change is the very

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:03.480
definition of uncertainty. It feels like

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:05.280
a lot of effort and naturally your brain

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:07.560
would try to protect your efforts.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:09.920
Sometimes people would do all kinds of

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:12.280
mental gymnastics and waste their energy

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:14.480
ultimately just to convince themselves

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:16.920
that they can't change which isn't

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:19.720
helpful at all. Same thing goes if they

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:21.960
see someone else changing, your brain

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:23.760
sees that as a problem because there's

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:25.440
cognitive dissonance involved and their

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.000
brain goes, "This is so weird. I hate

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:29.600
this." So if your old identity was, "I'm

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:32.160
lazy." and now you want to be hard

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:34.120
working, your brain is like, "No, that's

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:35.720
not how things go around here." So

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:38.240
sometimes we have to put in extra

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:39.760
overtime to change those thoughts. So

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.280
when you're obsessing over something

